  "title": "PER: prevent UB",
  "description": "There's no need to cast the returned choice_index from unsigned to\nsigned, as it's only used to count down to zero. (If it's really large,\nthe loop will terminate for other reasons, such as running out of choices.)\n\nPrevents UB if choice_index becomes negative when cast to a signed\ninteger, and then overflows when decrementing.\n\nOSS-Fuzz Issue 448512782",
